{"title":"아! 형산파","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=Ju2Ss/hAdNUYE7Gv/JbLT4qIiKWtnDqPQv6wxn0&filename=th3","synopsis":"“형산파는 내 집이고, 사형제들은 내 가족이다!”\n\n무심한 아버지에게 외면당하고 새어머니의 핍박을 받다\n금자 스무 냥에 팔리듯 쫓겨 형산파로 온 소년 이군악.\n\n형산파에서 처음으로 사람의 애정을 받고 행복을 느꼈지만,\n사숙조와 함께 떠난 수련행은 생사지경의 비무와 고독만이 가득하고..\n형산파로 돌아가는 것만이 군악의 유일한 꿈이 된다.\n\n10년 후, 벼락을 맞고 형산파 독문무공 ‘금안뇌정신공’을 12성 가깝게 익힌 군악은\n드디어 형산파로 돌아가게 되는데...?!\n\n형산파와 사형제들을 지키기 위한 이군악의 투쟁이 시작된다!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":91,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":102,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":88,"change":{"type":"up","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":81,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":84,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":85,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":91,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":92,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":89,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":101,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":90,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":98,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":98,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":85,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":100,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":114,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":111,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":121,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":115,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":191,"change":{"type":"down","amount":76}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":112,"change":{"type":"up","amount":79}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":107,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},